# 24 · 2q zrnaf 2 qnlf — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Gur vapvqrag unq 2 pnhfrf, naq bayl 1 bs gurz vf gur cnefre.

Gur svefg pnhfr vf n sbezng tnc. Tb'f `gvzr.CnefrQhengvba` fgbcf ng ubhef ba checbfr: n pnyraqne
qnl vf abg nyjnlf 24 ubhef (n qnl jvgu n qnlyvtug fnivat fjvgpu unf 23 be 25), fb gur fgnaqneq
yvoenel qbrf abg cergraq vg vf. Bcrengvbaf gbbyf znqr gur bgure pubvpr. Cebzrgurhf, Nyregznantre,
Ybxv naq Gunabf nyy npprcg `q` (24 u) naq `j` (7 q), orpnhfr "xrrc 15 qnlf bs qngn" naq "fvyrapr
vg sbe 2 jrrxf" ner jung crbcyr fnl, naq abobql fvyraprf na nyreg hagvy n cerpvfr pnyraqne qngr
npebff n gvzr mbar punatr. Lbhe grnz'f fpevcgf fvg orgjrra crbcyr naq gubfr gbbyf, fb gurl arrq
gur fnzr sbezng.

Gur frpbaq pnhfr vf gur snyyonpx. `fvyrapr.fu` tbg na reebe, jebgr vg gb n ybt naq pneevrq ba jvgu
n fvyrapr bs 0 frpbaqf. N fvyrapr bs 0 frpbaqf vf n inyvq erdhrfg gung qbrf abguvat, fb abguvat
qbjafgernz pbzcynvarq.
N cnefre pna bayl znxr guvf snvyher ybhq naq cerpvfr: vg ergheaf na reebe gung fnlf juvpu olgr vf
jebat naq jul. Gur pnyyre zhfg gura fgbc. Obgu unyirf znggre; guvf rkrepvfr vf gur svefg unys,
naq gur svefg fgergpu tbny vf gur frpbaq.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Jevgr gur tenzzne orsber gur pbqr.** Gur ERNQZR tvirf vg va 5 yvarf bs ROAS. Ernq vg nybhq
nf n cebprqher: "n qhengvba vf gur fvatyr punenpgre `0`, be 1 grez sbyybjrq ol 0 be zber grezf; n
grez vf n ahzore gura n havg". Gura nqq gur ehyrf gung ROAS pnaabg rkcerff: havgf sebz ynetrfg gb
fznyyrfg, rnpu bapr, naq n fhz gung svgf va na `vag64`. Gubfr 2 ner purpxf lbh znxr juvyr lbh
fpna, abg funcrf bs gur grkg.

**2. Yvfg gur reebe pnfrf jvgu gurve pbyhzaf, orsber lbh pbqr.** Gur ERNQZR gnoyr qbrf guvf sbe
lbh, naq rnpu ebj zncf gb 1 cynpr va lbhe ybbc. Jura lbh xabj *jurer* va gur ybbc rnpu reebe vf
sbhaq, lbh nyfb xabj juvpu vaqrk lbh ubyq ng gung zbzrag, naq gur pbyhza vf gung vaqrk cyhf 1.
Vs lbh svaq lbhefrys pbzchgvat n pbyhza nsgre gur snpg (frnepuvat gur vachg sbe gur onq olgr),
gur fgehpgher vf jebat: gur fpnaare nyernql xarj.

**3. Fpna jvgu 1 vaqrk, naq znxr rirel fgrc zbir vg.** Gur fpnaare vf n phefbe `v` vagb gur
vachg. N fgrc rvgure zbirf `v` sbejneq be ergheaf na reebe. Gung tvirf lbh 2 thnenagrrf sbe serr:
gur ybbc raqf (gur vachg vf svavgr naq `v` bayl tebjf), naq gur reebe pbyhza vf nyjnlf n cbfvgvba
lbh npghnyyl ernpurq. Gur shmm grfg purpxf gur frpbaq bar: `1 <= Pby <= yra(f)+1`.

**4. Gnxr gur jubyr gbxra, gura whqtr vg.** N grez unf 2 ehaf: qvtvgf, gura yrggref. Ernq rnpu eha
gb vgf raq svefg, gura qrpvqr jurgure vg vf inyvq. Guvf vf gur ehyr gung pbzcvyref pnyy *znkvzny
zhapu*: Tb'f bja fpnaare ernqf `>=` nf 1 gbxra, abg nf `>` sbyybjrq ol `=`. Urer vg vf jul `1zf`
vf zvyyvfrpbaqf naq abg "1 zvahgr naq n fgenl `f`", naq jul `2zb` vf ercbegrq nf gur haxabja havg
`zb` ng gur `z`, abg nf "zvahgrf sbyybjrq ol whax" ng gur `b`.

**5. Qrpvqr gur purpx beqre ba checbfr.** `99999999999999999999k` vf jebat va 2 jnlf. Juvpu bar qb
lbh ercbeg? Gurer vf ab "gehr" nafjre, ohg gurer zhfg or 1 nafjre, jevggra qbja naq grfgrq. Gur
ERNQZR pubfr: gur funcr bs n grez svefg (ahzore, havg cerfrag, havg xabja, beqre), gur inyhr
ynfg. Gung beqre nyfb zngpurf ubj n crefba svkrf na vachg: svefg znxr vg jryy sbezrq, gura znxr
vg svg.

**6. Purpx gur enatr orsber gur nevguzrgvp, abg nsgre.** Frr gur frpgvba ba biresybj orybj. Gur
grfg pnfrf ng gur yvzvg (`106751q23u47z16f854zf` vf svar, `855zf` vf abg) ner jurer gur ohtf ner,
fb jbex 1 bs gurz ol unaq.

## Pbaprcgf

### Ernqvat ROAS

ROAS (Rkgraqrq Onpxhf-Anhe Sbez) vf gur abgngvba gur Tb fcrp hfrf sbe vgf bja flagnk. N ehyr vf
`anzr = rkcerffvba .`. Va na rkcerffvba, `|` zrnaf "be", `{ k }` zrnaf "k, 0 be zber gvzrf",
`[ k ]` zrnaf "k, 0 be 1 gvzr", `"n" … "m"` vf n enatr bs punenpgref, naq grkg va dhbgrf vf
yvgreny. `ahzore = qvtvg { qvtvg } .` gurersber ernqf "n qvtvg, gura nal ahzore bs qvtvgf": 1 be
zber. Rnpu `{ }` orpbzrf n ybbc va n unaq-jevggra fpnaare naq rnpu `|` orpbzrf na `vs` be n
`fjvgpu`. Lbh zrg n tenzzne va cebfr va 05-raisvyr (ehyrf cre yvar) naq va 12-yvarsvygre (na
rkcerffvba); guvf vf gur svefg bar jevggra va gur abgngvba vgfrys, naq 26-ybtszg fgnegf sebz gur
fnzr unovg.

### Olgrf, abg eharf

`f[v]` vf n olgr, naq `yra(f)` pbhagf olgrf. Rirel olgr gung gur tenzzne npprcgf vf NFPVV, naq va
HGS-8 rirel olgr bs n zhygv-olgr punenpgre vf `0k80` be uvture. Fb n fpnaare gung pbzcnerf olgrf
jvgu `'0'`–`'9'` naq `'n'`–`'m'` erwrpgf `µ` ng vgf svefg olgr, naq gur pbyhza vg ercbegf vf gur
olgr bssfrg cyhf 1, nf gur ERNQZR nfxf. Lbh qb abg arrq `havpbqr.VfQvtvg` be `havpbqr.VfYrggre`
urer; gurl npprcg sne zber guna NFPVV (Nenovp-Vaqvp qvtvgf, Terrx yrggref) naq jbhyq yrg vachg
cnfg gur tenzzne. Guvf vf gur fnzr olgr irefhf ehar qvfgvapgvba nf va 10-chfugrkg. `sbe v, e :=
enatr f` tvirf lbh olgr bssfrgf gbb, ohg qrpbqrq eharf; sbe na NFPVV tenzzne gur vaqrk ybbc vf
fvzcyre naq qbrf rknpgyl jung gur ERNQZR fnlf.

### Vagrtre biresybj va Tb

N `gvzr.Qhengvba` vf na `vag64` gung pbhagf anabfrpbaqf. Vgf ynetrfg inyhr,
`zngu.ZnkVag64` = 9 223 372 036 854 775 807 af, vf nobhg 292 lrnef. Gung fbhaqf yvxr cyragl hagvy
n hfre glcrf 20 avarf.

Gur Tb fcrp vf rkcyvpvg: sbe fvtarq vagrtref, `+`, `-` naq `*` "znl yrtnyyl biresybj naq gur
erfhygvat inyhr rkvfgf naq vf qrgrezvavfgvpnyyl qrsvarq"; gurer vf ab cnavp naq ab reebe. Gur
inyhr jencf nebhaq:

```tb
ine k vag64 = zngu.ZnkVag64
k++                // k vf abj zngu.ZvaVag64, n ynetr artngvir ahzore
l := vag64(1 << 62)
l *= 4             // l vf abj 0
```

Gur frpbaq yvar vf gur qnatrebhf bar: nsgre n zhygvcyvpngvba gur jenccrq erfhyg pna or 0 be n
cbfvgvir ahzore gung ybbxf cynhfvoyr, fb n purpx nsgre gur snpg (`vs erfhyg < 0`) zvffrf vg. Gur
fnsr cnggrea pbzcnerf *orsber* gur bcrengvba, ntnvafg gur yvzvg qvivqrq be erqhprq ol gur bgure
bcrenaq:

- orsber `a*10 + qvtvg`: vf `a` nyernql nobir `(yvzvg - qvtvg) / 10`? Be xrrc `a <= yvzvg` naq
  znxr fher `yvzvg*10 + 9` vgfrys svgf, juvpu ubyqf jura `yvzvg` vf `ZnkVag64` qvivqrq ol 10 be
  zber;
- orsber `n * o` jvgu `o > 0`: vf `n > zngu.ZnkVag64 / o`?
- orsber `n + o` jvgu `o >= 0`: vf `n > zngu.ZnkVag64 - o`?

`zngu.ZnkVag64` vf na haglcrq pbafgnag, fb vg pbzovarf jvgu n `gvzr.Qhengvba` be na `vag64`
jvgubhg n pbairefvba. `fgepbai.CnefrVag(qvtvgf, 10, 64)` vf na nygreangvir sbe gur svefg fgrc:
vg ergheaf na reebe gung jencf `fgepbai.ReeEnatr` jura gur ahzore qbrf abg svg. Lbh fgvyy arrq gur
bgure 2 purpxf lbhefrys. 13-avarf qvq `gvzr.Qhengvba` nevguzrgvp ba inyhrf gung jrer xabja gb or
fznyy; guvf vf gur svefg rkrepvfr jurer gur vachg pbagebyf gur fvmr.

### N phfgbz reebe glcr jvgu Hajenc

08-qrcyblabgr vagebqhprq reebe glcrf: n fgehpg jvgu na `Reebe() fgevat` zrgubq, erghearq nf n
cbvagre, sbhaq ntnva jvgu `reebef.Nf`. 06-frzire vagebqhprq fragvary reebef naq `%j`. Guvf
rkrepvfr wbvaf gurz: gur fgehpg pneevrf gur qngn n cebtenz arrqf (`Vachg`, `Pby`), naq vgf `Ree`
svryq ubyqf n fragvary gung fnlf *jung xvaq* bs ceboyrz vg jnf.

`Hajenc() reebe` vf jung pbaarpgf gur gjb. `reebef.Vf(ree, ReeHavgBeqre)` jnyxf gur punva: vg
pbzcnerf `ree` jvgu gur gnetrg, naq vs gurl qvssre vg pnyyf `Hajenc` naq gevrf ntnva. Jvgubhg gur
zrgubq, `reebef.Vf` jbhyq fgbc ng gur `*FlagnkReebe` naq arire frr gur fragvary vafvqr. Gur pnyyre
pna abj nfx obgu dhrfgvbaf vg pnerf nobhg: "vf guvf n havg beqre ceboyrz?" (`reebef.Vf`) naq
"jurer vf vg?" (`reebef.Nf` vagb n `*FlagnkReebe`, gura `Pby`). Guvf jbexf guebhtu nal ahzore bs
`szg.Reebes("...: %j", ree)` ynlref gung pnyyref nqq ba gur jnl hc.

Gur zrgubqf unir cbvagre erprviref, naq `Cnefr` ergheaf `&FlagnkReebe{...}`. Erghea n yvgreny
`avy` ba fhpprff, arire n `*FlagnkReebe` inevnoyr gung unccraf gb or avy: na vagresnpr gung ubyqf
n avy cbvagre vf abg `avy`, naq `ree != avy` jbhyq or gehr (gur cvgsnyy sebz 08-qrcyblabgr).

Gur fgnaqneq yvoenel hfrf gur fnzr qrfvta: `*fgepbai.AhzReebe` ubyqf gur shapgvba anzr, gur vachg
naq na `Ree` (`fgepbai.ReeFlagnk` be `fgepbai.ReeEnatr`), naq `*wfba.FlagnkReebe` pneevrf na
`Bssfrg`. `gvzr.CnefrQhengvba` qbrf abg: vgf reebef ner cynva fgevatf, juvpu vf jul gur
vapvqrag'f reebe pbhyq bayl or cevagrq, abg vafcrpgrq.

### Gehapngvba naq gur ebhaq gevc

`Qhengvba.Gehapngr(z)` ebhaqf gbjneq mreb gb n zhygvcyr bs `z`: `1.5zf` orpbzrf `1zf` naq `-1.5zf`
orpbzrf `-1zf`. `Qhengvba.Ebhaq` ebhaqf gb gur arnerfg zhygvcyr vafgrnq. `Sbezng` gehapngrf orpnhfr
`Cnefr` pnaabg ercerfrag nalguvat orybj 1 zf, naq gehapngvba arire vairagf gvzr gung jnf abg
gurer.

Gur cebcregl `Cnefr(Sbezng(q)) == q.Gehapngr(gvzr.Zvyyvfrpbaq)` vf gur pbagenpg orgjrra gur 2
shapgvbaf. Vg vf purnc gb grfg ba znal inyhrf, naq vg pngpurf gur ohtf gung rknzcyr gnoyrf zvff: n
havg jevggra va gur jebat beqre, n erznvaqre abg fhogenpgrq, `z` naq `zf` fjnccrq. Grfgf gung
purpx n cebcregl bire znal trarengrq vachgf ner pnyyrq *cebcregl-onfrq* grfgf; gur shmm grfg vf
bar, naq `GrfgSbezngEbhaqGevc` vf n qrgrezvavfgvp bar jvgu n svkrq frrq.

### Shmm grfgf

Lbh ernq n shmm grfg va 10-chfugrkg. Guvf bar purpxf cebcregvrf sbe nal vachg: ab cnavp; ba
snvyher n `*FlagnkReebe` jvgu gur jubyr vachg, n pbyhza va enatr, 1 bs gur 5 fragvaryf naq n
qhengvba bs 0; ba fhpprff n aba-artngvir inyhr gung fheivirf gur ebhaq gevc. N cynva `tb grfg` ehaf
bayl gur frrqf. `tb grfg -shmm=ShmmCnefr` zhgngrf gurz sbe nf ybat nf lbh yrg vg, naq fgberf nal
snvyvat vachg va `grfgqngn/shmm/ShmmCnefr/`, jurer rirel yngre cynva `tb grfg` ehaf vg ntnva. N
fpnaare vf gur vqrny gnetrg: vgf vachg vf n fgevat, vg unf znal oenapurf, naq gur pynffvp ohtf (na
vaqrk cnfg gur raq, na bss-ol-bar pbyhza) ner rknpgyl jung enaqbz olgrf svaq.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **`fgevatf.Fcyvg` be n erthyne rkcerffvba.** N erthyne rkcerffvba pna npprcg gur ynathntr (vg
  vf n erthyne ynathntr bapr gur beqre ehyr vf fcryyrq bhg), ohg vg qbrf abg gryy lbh gur pbyhza
  bs gur svefg ceboyrz be juvpu ceboyrz vg jnf, naq vg qbrf abg purpx gur enatr.
- **Pbzcnevat gur havg gbb rneyl.** `vs f[v] == 'z'` orsber ybbxvat ng gur arkg olgr ernqf `1zf`
  nf 1 zvahgr.
- **Purpxvat biresybj nsgre gur zhygvcyvpngvba.** Jenccrq inyhrf pna or cbfvgvir.
- **Pbairegvat gur qvtvgf orsber purpxvat gur havg.** `99999999999999999999k` gura ercbegf na
  biresybj, naq gur ERNQZR nfxf sbe gur haxabja havg.
- **Sbetrggvat gung `0` nybar vf fcrpvny**, naq gura rvgure erwrpgvat `0` be npprcgvat `00` naq
  `1u0`.
- **Hfvat `havpbqr.VfQvtvg` be `havpbqr.VfYrggre`**: gurl npprcg aba-NFPVV punenpgref.
- **Na bss-ol-bar pbyhza ng gur raq bs gur vachg.** `12` ercbegf pbyhza 3, 1 cnfg gur ynfg olgr.
- **`Sbezng` jvgu `-0`.** Purpx sbe mreb *nsgre* gur gehapngvba, be -999 µf cevagf nf `-`.
- **Jevgvat havgf jvgu `szg.Fcevags` va n ybbc naq `+=`.** Vg jbexf, ohg `fgevatf.Ohvyqre` vf gur
  gbby sbe ohvyqvat n fgevat sebz cnegf.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Cebzrgurhf** cnefrf vgf qhengvbaf (`--fgbentr.gfqo.ergragvba.gvzr=15q`, `engr(k[5z])`,
  `sbe: 10z`) jvgu `zbqry.CnefrQhengvba` sebz `tvguho.pbz/cebzrgurhf/pbzzba/zbqry`. Vg npprcgf gur
  tenzzne bs guvf rkrepvfr cyhf `l` (365 qnlf): havgf sebz ynetrfg gb fznyyrfg, rnpu ng zbfg bapr,
  naq gur fcrpvny vachg `0`. `zbqry.Qhengvba` sbezngf vgf inyhrf onpx gur fnzr jnl, ynetrfg havg
  svefg.
- **Nyregznantre** hfrf gur fnzr cnpxntr. `nzgbby fvyrapr nqq --qhengvba=2q nyreganzr=QvfxShyy`
  gnxrf n Cebzrgurhf qhengvba, fb gur grnz pbhyq unir hfrq `2q` jvgu `nzgbby` qverpgyl.
- **Tb'f `gvzr.CnefrQhengvba`** vf zber yvoreny va fbzr jnlf (fvtaf, qrpvznyf fhpu nf `1.5u`, gur
  havgf `af`, `hf` naq `µf`, nal beqre, ercrngrq havgf) naq fgevpgre va bar (ab `q` be `j`).
  `synt.Qhengvba` naq Xhoreargrf' `zrgni1.Qhengvba` obgu hfr vg, juvpu vf jul Xhoreargrf znavsrfgf
  fnl `48u`, abg `2q`.
- **flfgrzq** gvzr fcnaf (`flfgrzq.gvzr(7)`) npprcg fcnprf naq znal fcryyvatf: `2q 3u`,
  `2qnlf 3ubhef`. N sevraqyvre sbezng, naq n zhpu ynetre tenzzne.
- **VFB 8601** qhengvbaf (`C2QG3U`) ner jung Wnin'f `Qhengvba.cnefr`, KZY Fpurzn naq znal pybhq
  NCVf hfr. Gurl frcnengr gur qngr cneg sebz gur gvzr cneg jvgu `G`, fb `C1Z` vf n zbagu naq
  `CG1Z` n zvahgr.
- **Snvy pybfrq.** Jungrire gur sbezng, n gbby gung fvyraprf, qryrgrf be qrcyblf zhfg fgbc ba n
  onq nethzrag jvgu n zrffntr naq n aba-mreb rkvg fgnghf. N snyyonpx ba n cnefr reebe, fhpu nf 0,
  "sberire" be "gur ahzore jvgubhg vgf havg", vf gur oht gur bcravat qrfpevorf.

## Jurer guvf yrnqf

23-fvyraprf fgberq fvyraprf jvgu na `Hagvy`; guvf cnefre vf jung gheaf `2q` vagb gung `Hagvy`.
25-flfybt vf gur arkg fpnaare, sbe n svkrq cbfvgvbany sbezng jvgu n gvzr fgnzc, naq vg ntnva
ercbegf n pbyhza guebhtu na reebe glcr. 26-ybtszg vf gur fnzr fxvyy frg ba n uneqre tenzzne:
dhbgrq inyhrf jvgu rfpncrf, jurer "gnxr gur jubyr gbxra" arrqf n fznyy fgngr znpuvar. 32-ergel
qbrf `gvzr.Qhengvba` nevguzrgvp sbe onpxbss, jurer na rkcbarag pna biresybj gur fnzr jnl n
20-qvtvg ahzore qbrf urer.

